==> [5/5] constraint_tests.sql (8 tests; each must be refused by the database)
--- Test 1: capacity exceeded: a 5-tier order on a day with 1 unit left ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:36: NOTICE:  TEST 1 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE P0001, Capacity exceeded: branch 1 on 2026-12-22 would have 6/1 units used)
DO
--- Test 2: decorator double-booked (overlapping window, same decorator) ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:62: NOTICE:  TEST 2 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE 23P01, conflicting key value violates exclusion constraint "exc_no_overlap_per_decorator")
DO
--- Test 3: due_date only 1 day after order_date ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:85: NOTICE:  TEST 3 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE 23514, new row for relation "cake_order" violates check constraint "chk_due_after_order")
DO
--- Test 4: confirm an order with a deposit under 50% ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:110: NOTICE:  TEST 4 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE P0001, Cannot confirm order 50212: deposit 1000.00 is less than 50% of 18000.00)
DO
--- Test 5: illegal status jump READY -> BAKING ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:139: NOTICE:  TEST 5 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE P0001, Invalid status transition READY -> BAKING on order 50213)
DO
--- Test 6: revive a CANCELLED order ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:165: NOTICE:  TEST 6 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE P0001, Order 50214 is CANCELLED and cannot be revived to CONFIRMED)
DO
--- Test 7: tiers out of range (0) ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:188: NOTICE:  TEST 7 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE 23514, new row for relation "cake_order" violates check constraint "cake_order_tiers_check")
DO
--- Test 8: negative price ---
psql:constraint_tests.sql:211: NOTICE:  TEST 8 PASS (refused: SQLSTATE 23514, new row for relation "cake_order" violates check constraint "cake_order_unit_price_ngn_check")
DO
